Originally coded by Andy Friesen (andy@ikagames.com) 15 November 2003 Evolved by Russel Winder (russel@winder.org.uk) 2010-02-07 onwards Compiler variables: DC The name of the D compiler to use. Defaults to dmd or gdmd, whichever is found. DPATH List of paths to search for import modules. DVERSIONS List of version tags to enable when compiling. DDEBUG List of debug tags to enable when compiling. Linker related variables: LIBS List of library files to link in. DLINK Name of the linker to use. Defaults to dmd or gdmd, whichever is found. DLINKFLAGS List of linker flags. Lib tool variables: DLIB Name of the lib tool to use. Defaults to lib. DLIBFLAGS List of flags to pass to the lib tool. LIBS Same as for the linker. (libraries to pull into the .lib)","parentId":"acm000002768jsd","content":["acm000002074jsd","acm000002075jsd"],"pathElements":["Tool"],"extension":"py","language":"PYTHON3","importedModuleNames":["SCons.Action","SCons.Builder","SCons.Defaults","SCons.Scanner.D","SCons.Tool","SCons.Tool.DCommon"]},"acm000002077jsd":{"type":"ControlElement","id":"acm000002077jsd","name":"generate","comment":"The suffix is hard-coded to '.dvi', not configurable via a\nconstruction variable like $DVISUFFIX, because the output\nfile name is hard-coded within TeX.","startLine":33,"endLine":49,"calleeNames":["Builder"]},"acm000002078jsd":{"type":"ControlElement","id":"acm000002078jsd","name":"exists","comment":"This only puts a skeleton Builder in place, so if someone\nreferences this Tool directly, it's always \"available.\"\nLocal Variables:\ntab-width:4\nindent-tabs-mode:nil\nEnd:\nvim: set expandtab tabstop=4 shiftwidth=4:","startLine":51,"endLine":54,"calleeNames":[]},"acm000002079jsd":{"type":"CodeCompilationUnit","id":"acm000002079jsd","name":"dvi","comment":"MIT License\n\nCopyright The SCons Foundation\n\nPermission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining\na copy of this software and associated documentation files (the\n\"Software\"), to deal in the S